{"4528290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Everhold", "steam_appid": 4528290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FAST PACED COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everhold's combat is rapid and chaotic with swarms of dangerous enemies blocking your path and attempting to end your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo attack and use weapons power moves to ensure that you make it back to base with all of your precious loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4528290/extras/9b5271459b57cebe2e19134d39160a77.avif?t=1786827425\" width=1067 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANDOMLY GENERATED LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everhold offers a huge variety of randomly generated rooms ensuring you hours of new and interesting layouts for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle and challenge rooms with bonus rewards can also be found while exploring, giving you and your friends the opportunity to find even more loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4528290/extras/392008aa0f2973d239587f4fb6b2233d.avif?t=1786827425\" width=1067 height=600 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWERFUL EQUIPMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your adventures within the Everhold, collect and upgrade tons of powerful equipment and build you ideal loadout to face powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect crafting ingredients to upgrade your equipment and make a variety of spells to become even more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p